# Outfit camera: a boxy reportage camera with a big flash gun (signal yellow: a thing the player uses) (R23).
# Regridded to 5 cm voxels (R1 floor, CP7).
name outfit_boxcam
grid 5
size 6 5 8
slot body Ink
slot lens Steel
slot flash Signal
slot trim SwatchAccent
box 0 0 0 4 5 4 body
box 0 0 4 4 5 5 trim
beam 4 2 2 6 2 2 1 lens
beam 2 4 4 2 4 6 1 lens
box 1 2 6 4 5 8 flash
pivot 2 2 0
